  "question": {
    "text": "G.M. and H. M. of two numbers are 10 and 8 respectively. The numbers are :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "5,20",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "4,25",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "2,50",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "1,100",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $\\sqrt{\\mathrm{ab}}=10 \\Rightarrow a b=100$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{2 a b}{a+b}=8 \\\\\n& a+b=25\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nSo $a=5, b=20$"
